er-interview/">0 comments</a></div></li><li><a class="float_left margin-right10 smaller_image" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160420010739/http://navajocodetalkers.org/kee-etsicitty-real-code-talker-interview/"><img width="170" height="170" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160420010739im_/http://navajocodetalkers.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/Kee-Etsicitty-Real-Code-Talker-Interview-170x170.jpg" class="attachment-anivia-news wp-post-image" alt="Kee Etsicitty Real Code Talker Interview"/></a><div class="anivia_widget_group"><h5><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160420010739/http://navajocodetalkers.org/kee-etsicitty-real-code-talker-interview/">Kee Etsicitty: Real Code Talker Interview</a></h5><span class="overflow_ellipsis">Kee Etsicitty is a native of the Navajo reservation and served&#8230;</span><a class="anivia_group_comments" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160420010739/http://navajocodetalkers.org/kee-etsicitty-real-code-talker-interview/">0 comments</a></div></li></ul></aside>			</div>
